    "39d6d9ae-df4a-49e8-af94-5cd5971530a9"], Cell["For the gluon Ward \
identity, replace its polarisation by p\:2084. The factors (slash p\:2081 \
\[Minus] m) and (slash p\:2082 + m) impose the incoming antiquark and quark \
Dirac equations while keeping all spin states. The resulting matrix must \
vanish. The result should be True.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
    "f5dc1ef0-cf70-47e9-af6e-ecfe002cc852"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"gluonResidual", "=", 
        RowBox[{"onShell", "[", RowBox[{"FeynGravSimplify", "[", 
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"GSD", "[", "p1", "]"}], 
                  "-", "m"}], ")"}], ".", RowBox[{"onShell", "[", 
                RowBox[{"amplitudeTensor", " ", RowBox[{"FVD", "[", 
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"Polarization", "[", RowBox[{"p3", ",", 
                          RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
