  Cell["These checks concern this complete tree amplitude. They do not \
establish loop identities, renormalisation, or every higher-point process. \
The model cutoff is \[Kappa]\262 per vertex, not a restriction on the total \
order of every diagram.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
    "f81da757-9b5b-41f6-b201-e7c1a15695c5"]}, 
